      "answer": "A",
      "note": "Đáp án đúng là: A Ta có: \\(\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt[3]{{18}} = \\sqrt[3]{{18.{{\\left( {\\frac{2}{3}} \\right)}^3}}} = \\sqrt[3]{{18.\\frac{8}{{27}}}} = \\sqrt[3]{{\\frac{{16}}{3}}} = \\sqrt[3]{{5\\frac{1}{3}}}\\). \\(\\frac{3}{4}\\sqrt[3]{{12}} = \\sqrt[3]{{12.{{\\left( {\\frac{3}{4}} \\right)}^3}}} = \\sqrt[3]{{12.\\frac{{27}}{{64}}}} = \\sqrt[3]{{\\frac{{81}}{{16}}}} = \\sqrt[3]{{5\\frac{1}{{16}}}}\\). Ta có: \\(5\\frac{1}{3} > 5\\frac{1}{{16}}\\) nên \\(\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt[3]{{18}} > \\frac{3}{4}\\sqrt[3]{{12}}\\)."
    },
